            "description_html": "<b>Modern Satin Stainless Steel Fingertip Edge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe satin stainless steel finish and modern shape of this finger edge pull proves that even the smallest details in decorating can make a big difference. Fingertip pulls such as this one are a simple solution to the problem of getting pocket doors out of their pocket. Easy to install, the Satin Stainless Steel Fingertip Edge Pull comes with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-310-dimentions.gif?v=1704354625\" width=\"404\" height=\"160\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Canaropa JNF-310 Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Round Small Edge Door Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\" (30 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Cutout Diameter: 3/4\" (20 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Length: 3/4\" (20 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Dimeter: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
